-03:00', '2026-04-10T13:07:35-03:00', '2026-04-10T13:07:35-03:00', 1, 0, 6, 23, 1, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 2001, 'Freemium', 'zonajobs', 'freemium', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.zonajobs.com.ar/aviso/2179173', '2026-04-13T08:07:34.666904');
